WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.345
Welcome to your Estate Aegis demo.

00:00:02.345 --> 00:00:06.795
This quick start will help you find your way around in just a few minutes.

00:00:06.795 --> 00:00:10.644
Open the invitation in your email and choose Activate your demo.

00:00:10.644 --> 00:00:13.350
Enter your name and choose your own password.

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:16.478
Your seven days begin when registration is complete.

00:00:16.478 --> 00:00:18.101
No credit card is required.

00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:21.830
Keep the quick-start link handy whenever you need a refresher.

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:27.563
For later visits, open Estate Aegis dot com slash login and choose Admin.

00:00:27.563 --> 00:00:31.267
Client and Vendor are separate views for those account types.

00:00:31.267 --> 00:00:34.121
Use the email and password you registered with.

00:00:34.121 --> 00:00:36.367
Your demo is private to your company.

00:00:36.367 --> 00:00:42.500
The following screen examples use demonstration names; the sample names in
your workspace may differ.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:44.935
Start on Overview.

00:00:44.935 --> 00:00:51.054
Expand Action needed to see what needs attention, or choose a dashboard
tile to open its records.

00:00:51.054 --> 00:00:53.325
The left menu groups the main tools.

00:00:53.325 --> 00:00:56.037
On a smaller screen, tap Menu to reveal it.

00:00:56.037 --> 00:01:00.390
Residences and Clients is your starting point for families and homes.

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:03.670
Daily Operations brings the company's work together.

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:08.791
Open Residences, then choose a sample home's residence card.

00:01:08.791 --> 00:01:10.701
This is that home's dashboard.

00:01:10.701 --> 00:01:15.350
Its tabs keep inspections, shopping, arrivals and other records together.

00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:19.935
Overview shows upcoming work, recent inspections and family information.

00:01:19.935 --> 00:01:26.239
You can explore the prepared sample first, then try adding your own
fictional family and residence.

00:01:26.239 --> 00:01:28.850
Create the family before adding its home.

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:35.132
Open the residence's Inspections tab and choose a draft, or start an
inspection.

00:01:35.132 --> 00:01:39.989
Work through the checklist, using Pass, Monitor or Attention for each
finding.

00:01:39.989 --> 00:01:43.912
Add a short note so the next person understands what you found.

00:01:43.912 --> 00:01:45.531
Save your draft as you go.

00:01:45.531 --> 00:01:51.820
In your private demo, report emails are disabled, so you can practice
without emailing a real client.

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:59.899
To explore the repair workflow, complete and publish a practice
inspection, then use its finding's work-order action.

00:01:59.899 --> 00:02:03.202
Review the title, description and due date before saving.

00:02:03.202 --> 00:02:07.721
The linked work order lets you track the issue through service and
completion.

00:02:07.721 --> 00:02:12.820
You can also create a practice work order directly from Work orders in
Daily Operations.

00:02:14.120 --> 00:02:17.846
Back in the residence, open Shopping to review preferred items.

00:02:17.846 --> 00:02:21.217
Then open Arrivals and explore the upcoming sample visit.

00:02:21.217 --> 00:02:27.605
Check the needs, groceries and room preparation so you can see what must
be ready before the family arrives.

00:02:27.605 --> 00:02:32.100
These records give your team one place to coordinate the home's
preparation.

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:34.607
Ready to start over?

00:02:34.607 --> 00:02:36.357
Use Reset demo in the banner.

00:02:36.357 --> 00:02:42.333
Confirm only when you are ready to remove your practice records and
uploads and restore the sample.

00:02:42.333 --> 00:02:46.739
Your login stays the same, and resetting does not extend your seven days.

00:02:46.739 --> 00:02:49.213
The banner also links back to this guide.

00:02:49.213 --> 00:02:57.180
Use the full tutorial for deeper walkthroughs, or contact sales at estate
aegis dot com for help, more time or subscription options.
